   pnum(t)              "Model numeraire"

   walras               "Walras check"

*  Closure variables

   dintx(r,i,aa,t)      "Indirect taxes on consumption of domestic goods"
   mintx(r,i,aa,t)      "Indirect taxes on consumption of import goods"
